  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1f7f716162a964745ace8b4d3506cd21, type: 3}
  m_Name: 05_FigureSequence
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  texts:
  - Are you still worried?
  - "I\u2019ve lost a lot of sleep thinking about it."
  - "Those thoughts won\u2019t matter. You won\u2019t even remember them."
  - "I don\u2019t know what I'll do when that happens."
  - Once the traction is gone completely your memories will slowly dissolve leaving
    only holes behind.
  - "At first you\u2019ll at least have that - a voice saying \u201Csomething was
    here.\u201D"
  - "Eventually you won\u2019t even notice the voids."
  - The infection will spread from your memories to your rationality and judgement
    until your identity is eroded away along with any perception of reality.
  - "What\u2019s left of who you are will pour out through the cracks."
  - What meaning does reality have if it can all be taken away that easily?
